Package: nova
Version: 1.3.5~dev2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Aslam <univercialdragon@gmail.com>
Depends: python, bash
Description: Universal Dragon NOVA portable multi-engine tool-language runtime for Termux.
 Includes portable launcher, nova core, qbit engine, adapter checker, examples, and multi-engine routing.
 Optional engines: nodejs, clang, rust, sqlite, Java.
